Henrik is an [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oreskian]] of [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/Sarengrad|Sarengrad]], where most of his past lies, and a member of the [[Org/Althane/Golden Sparrows|Golden Sparrows]]; while he ran with the movement he reported to [[People/Althane/Wojciech|Wojciech]]. He breaks into [[Org/Althane/The First House|First House]] buildings to steal medicine and to keep Sparrow refuges from being found. He goes into a fight in full armor and behind a shield.

He is a physician. He carries a device that can read a soul and cut at it, and he has turned it on the [[Phenomena/Althane/Wasting Fever|wasting fever]] that grips Oresk, whose rot he can watch spreading through his patients. He wants to treat the sickness in the soul itself and to teach other clinicians to do the same.

He travels with [[People/Althane/Lev|Lev]], [[People/Althane/Divex|Divex]] and [[People/Althane/Dawnmonger|Dawnmonger]] as [[Org/Althane/The Weft|the Weft]].
